{"seq":3,"slug":"var-expected-shortfall","title":"VaR与预期损失","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-risk-management/foundations/var-expected-shortfall","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"var与预期损失\">VaR与预期损失</h1><p>1990 年代初，J.P. Morgan 的董事长每天下班前要看一份「4:15 报告」，他只想知道一个数字：明天我们整个公司最多可能亏多少。为回答这个问题诞生的 RiskMetrics 方法，把风险价值（Value at Risk, VaR）推成了全行业的通用语言。这篇要讲清这门语言的语法——VaR 怎么算、它有什么致命缺陷、为什么监管最终用预期损失（Expected Shortfall, ES）取代了它。它把上一篇<a href=\"risk-measurement-statistics\">统计基础</a>的分布工具压缩成一个能上报告的数字，也是<a href=\"../regulation-stress-testing/basel-capital-regulation\">巴塞尔协议与资本监管</a>里资本计算的直接输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-var-把分布压成一个分位点\">核心概念：VaR 把分布压成一个分位点</h2><p>VaR 的定义只有一句话：在给定持有期和置信水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 下，损失不会超过的那个临界值。形式化地，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为损失，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{VaR}_\\alpha = \\inf\\{ \\ell : P(L \\le \\ell) \\ge \\alpha \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它本质上是损失分布的一个分位数。说「10 天 99% VaR 是 1 亿元」，意思是有 99% 的把握 10 天内亏不超过 1 亿元，或者说平均每 100 个 10 天里只有 1 个会亏得更多。</p>\n<p>VaR 的计算有三条主流路径，它们在准确性与计算成本之间各有取舍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[VaR 计算] --&gt; B[参数法&lt;br/&gt;方差-协方差]&#10;  A --&gt; C[历史模拟法]&#10;  A --&gt; D[蒙特卡洛模拟]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[假设正态&lt;br/&gt;快但漏肥尾]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[用真实历史分布&lt;br/&gt;无分布假设]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[模拟海量情景&lt;br/&gt;灵活但耗算力]&#10;  C1 --&gt; E[损失分布]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E&#10;  D1 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[取 α 分位点 = VaR]&#10;  E --&gt; G[取尾部均值 = ES]\">flowchart TD\n  A[VaR 计算] --&gt; B[参数法&lt;br/&gt;方差-协方差]\n  A --&gt; C[历史模拟法]\n  A --&gt; D[蒙特卡洛模拟]\n  B --&gt; B1[假设正态&lt;br/&gt;快但漏肥尾]\n  C --&gt; C1[用真实历史分布&lt;br/&gt;无分布假设]\n  D --&gt; D1[模拟海量情景&lt;br/&gt;灵活但耗算力]\n  C1 --&gt; E[损失分布]\n  B1 --&gt; E\n  D1 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[取 α 分位点 = VaR]\n  E --&gt; G[取尾部均值 = ES]</pre><p>下表对比三种方法的核心权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>核心假设</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参数法（方差-协方差）</td>\n<td>收益服从正态分布</td>\n<td>计算极快，解析解</td>\n<td>漏掉肥尾，对非线性组合失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史模拟法</td>\n<td>未来重演历史分布</td>\n<td>无分布假设，自动含肥尾</td>\n<td>受样本窗口限制，无未见情景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛模拟</td>\n<td>给定随机过程</td>\n<td>最灵活，处理非线性</td>\n<td>计算昂贵，依赖模型设定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三种算法各自的脾气\">三种算法各自的脾气</h2><p>参数法假设组合收益服从正态分布，于是 VaR 直接由波动率乘上一个分位数因子得到：99% 单尾对应约 2.33 倍标准差，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.33</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{VaR}_{99\\%} \\approx 2.33 \\, \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9024em;vertical-align:-0.2191em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">99%</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2191em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。它快得惊人，但代价是把<a href=\"risk-measurement-statistics\">上一篇</a>反复警告的肥尾彻底抹掉，对含期权的非线性组合也会严重失真。</p>\n<p>历史模拟法不假设任何分布，直接把过去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 天的收益率施加到当前组合上，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个假想损失，再取其经验分位数。它天然包含了历史上出现过的肥尾，但有两个软肋：样本窗口太短会漏掉极端事件，太长又会把过时的市场结构混进来；而且它永远无法生成历史上从未发生过的情景——这正是<a href=\"../regulation-stress-testing/stress-testing-scenarios\">压力测试</a>要补的缺口。</p>\n<p>蒙特卡洛法先设定风险因子的随机过程，再模拟成千上万条路径，对每条路径重新估值组合。它最灵活，能处理路径依赖期权这类复杂结构，但计算成本高，且结果的可靠性完全取决于你设定的随机过程是否贴近现实。</p>\n<h2 id=\"var-的致命缺陷-不满足次可加性\">VaR 的致命缺陷：不满足次可加性</h2><p>VaR 用了二十多年才暴露出它最深的问题：它不是一个「相容风险度量」（coherent risk measure）。1999 年 Artzner 等人提出，一个合格的风险度量应满足四条公理，其中最关键的是次可加性——分散化不应该增加风险，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(A+B) \\le \\rho(A) + \\rho(B)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。但 VaR 在某些情形下会违反它：两个组合合并后的 VaR 反而大于各自 VaR 之和。这意味着 VaR 可能惩罚分散化，甚至诱使机构去拆分头寸以「优化」监管数字。</p>\n<p>VaR 还有一个更直观的缺陷：它只告诉你「损失超过阈值的概率是 1%」，却对「一旦超过，到底会亏多少」一字不提。一个尾部缓和的组合和一个尾部灾难性的组合可以有完全相同的 VaR，但真实风险天差地别。对一个肥尾的世界来说，恰恰是「突破之后有多惨」才是最该关心的，而 VaR 对此视而不见。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预期损失-对尾部取平均\">预期损失：对尾部取平均</h2><p>ES（又称条件 VaR, CVaR）正是为修补这两个缺陷而生。它不看单个分位点，而是看「一旦损失超过 VaR，平均会亏多少」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mi>u</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ES}_\\alpha = \\frac{1}{1-\\alpha} \\int_\\alpha^1 \\mathrm{VaR}_u \\, du</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ES</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.476em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.564em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">VaR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉上，ES 是 VaR 阈值以外那段尾部的平均损失，因此一定大于等于同置信水平的 VaR。更重要的是，ES 满足全部四条相容性公理，包括 VaR 缺失的次可加性——它永远奖励分散化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>VaR</th>\n<th>ES（预期损失）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回答的问题</td>\n<td>阈值是多少</td>\n<td>突破后平均亏多少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次可加性</td>\n<td>不满足</td>\n<td>满足（相容）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部信息</td>\n<td>完全忽略</td>\n<td>完整捕捉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回测</td>\n<td>简单（数越界次数）</td>\n<td>较难（需估条件期望）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正因如此，巴塞尔委员会在「交易账簿根本性审查」（FRTB）中正式用 97.5% 的 ES 取代了 99% 的 VaR 作为市场风险资本的核心度量（来源：BIS 最低资本要求框架；Wikipedia: Expected shortfall）。选 97.5% 而非 99%，是因为在正态下二者数值接近，但 ES 对肥尾更敏感，监管以此换取尾部稳健性。这次度量切换的全部监管含义，在<a href=\"../regulation-stress-testing/basel-capital-regulation\">巴塞尔协议与资本监管</a>一篇里展开。</p>\n<p>不过 ES 也不是没有代价：它的回测比 VaR 难得多。VaR 回测只需数实际损失越界的次数，而 ES 是条件期望，难以直接观测，这也是早期监管迟迟不肯放弃 VaR 的原因之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>VaR 把整个损失分布压成一个分位点，回答「给定置信水平下损失最多多少」，是行业最通用的风险数字。</li>\n<li>三种算法各有取舍：参数法快但漏肥尾、历史模拟无分布假设但受样本限、蒙特卡洛最灵活但最贵。</li>\n<li>VaR 的两大缺陷：不满足次可加性（可能惩罚分散化），且对「突破阈值后亏多少」一无所知。</li>\n<li>ES 对尾部取平均，满足全部相容性公理，FRTB 已用 97.5% ES 取代 99% VaR 作为市场风险资本核心度量；代价是回测更难。</li>\n<li>VaR/ES 是贯穿全 hub 的度量语言，下一章<a href=\"../market-credit-risk/market-risk-hedging\">市场风险与对冲</a>将把它用到真实交易组合上。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"VaR与预期损失","id":"var与预期损失"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：VaR 把分布压成一个分位点","id":"核心概念-var-把分布压成一个分位点"},{"level":2,"text":"三种算法各自的脾气","id":"三种算法各自的脾气"},{"level":2,"text":"VaR 的致命缺陷：不满足次可加性","id":"var-的致命缺陷-不满足次可加性"},{"level":2,"text":"预期损失：对尾部取平均","id":"预期损失-对尾部取平均"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"风险度量的统计基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-risk-management/foundations/risk-measurement-statistics"},"next":{"title":"市场风险与对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-risk-management/market-credit-risk/market-risk-hedging"}}